

# feat: introduces a new feature
# fix: fixes a bug
# refactor: code changes that neither fix a bug nor introduce a feature
# test: addition of missing tests or corrections to existing tests
# docs: changes in documentation only
# style: code changes that do not impact the functionality
# perf: code changes that improve performance
# chore: changes that do not modify the source code or test files
# build: changes affecting the build system or external dependencies
# ci: changes to continuous integration configuration files and scripts
# revert: reverts a previously made commit

# reference: JIRA-1234
